# libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup between rounds.** Before each non-first iteration the wrapper runs [entity.sh](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/entity.sh) for **every** app in the previous round's include set. The next round therefore boots from an empty host, which guarantees cross-round state coherence: nothing the previous round deployed (whether it stays in the current round's closure or falls out) can leak into round R, so variants are free to disagree on which deps they pull in. The final round is followed by no purge so the last state remains available for inspection or follow-up specs."
msgstr "**Limpeza entre rounds.** Antes de cada iteración non inicial, o envoltorio corre [entity.sh](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/entity.sh) Para **cada** A aplicación na rolda anterior inclúe set. A seguinte rolda, polo tanto, botas dun hóspede baleiro, que garante a coherencia do estado: nada da rolda anterior despregada. (se queda no peche da rolda actual ou se cae) Pode filtrarse en R, polo que as variantes son libres de discrepar sobre os deps que tiran. A rolda final segue sen purga, polo que o último estado permanece dispoñible para inspeccións ou seguimentos."

