msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Inventario de carpetas.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) chamadas [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), Crea un cartafol por rolda en `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (Ou simplemente `<inventory-dir>` Cando hai unha única ronda)Para cada cartafol, `build_dev_inventory` resolve a carga de carga da variante per-app e frega-lo na do inventario `host_vars` como `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` Sobreira. Polo tanto, o inventario é resolto de forma variante no disco; non se require selector de tempo de execución."

