# libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, the backend command (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) imports the internal CA into a writable `cacerts` copy and points the JVM at it via `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. The shared `with-ca-trust.sh` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with `PKIX path building failed`. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework's CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM CA Trust (TLS asignado só)::** Cando `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, O comando backend (En `templates/compose.yml.j2`) Importa a CA interna a unha máquina `cacerts` Copia e apunta o JVM a través `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. O compartido `with-ca-trust.sh` O punto de entrada cobre o OS/NSS/env As tendas de confianza, pero non a truststore JVM, así que sen as chamadas OIDC do lado do servidor de Penpot a Keycloak fallan con Keycloak. `PKIX path building failed`. O Override está regulado detrás do modo autónomo. (é un non-op na produción, onde real CA-signed certs son xa fiables) E o camiño CA está codificado duro porque o código CA-override do framework re-serializa o comando."

