# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` with ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in ``trusted_proxies``. In swarm the hub joins the proxy’s own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub’s, and trusting only the hub’s subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Confianza inversa:** Render a ``configuration.yaml`` Con ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, E os CIDRs de confianza de todo o proxecto enumerados en ``trusted_proxies``. En swarm o centro únese á superposición propia do proxy, polo que a solicitude reenviada chega desde esa rede en lugar da do hub, e confiando só no subnet do hub fai que o Asistente de casa responda a cada solicitude proxiida con HTTP. 400."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` with `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in `trusted_proxies`. In swarm the hub joins the proxy's own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub's, and trusting only the hub's subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Confianza inversa:** Render a `configuration.yaml` Con `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, E os CIDRs de confianza de todo o proxecto enumerados en `trusted_proxies`. En swarm, o hub únese á superposición do proxy, polo que a solicitude reenviada chega desde esa rede en vez de desde o hub, e confiando só no subnet do hub fai que o Asistente de casa responda a cada solicitude proxida con HTTP. 400."

