# libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the ``sso`` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with ``?error=registration-disabled`` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` accordingly."
msgstr "**Auto-rexistro** Está *Sobre* Cando o BNG está habilitado e *Fóra* O contrario, tamén derivado do ``sso`` Bandeira de servizo. Penpot rutas primeiro OIDC logins a través do camiño de rexistro (unha bandeira desactivada fai que o callback falla ``?error=registration-disabled`` Para usuarios non previstos), O rexistro debe permanecer en calquera lugar onde estea OIDC. O administrador nativo é autoprovisionado e LDAP sen el. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renderes ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` En consecuencia."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the `sso` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with `?error=registration-disabled` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` accordingly."
msgstr "**Auto-rexistro** Está *Sobre* Cando o BNG está habilitado e *Fóra* O contrario, tamén derivado do `sso` Bandeira de servizo. Penpot rutas primeiro OIDC logins a través do camiño de rexistro (unha bandeira desactivada fai que o callback falla `?error=registration-disabled` Para usuarios non previstos), O rexistro debe permanecer en calquera lugar onde estea OIDC. O administrador nativo é autoprovisionado e LDAP sen el. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renderes `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` En consecuencia."

