# libretranslate
msgid "A `required: true` addon whose install step fails MUST fail the play (no `failed_when: false` swallowing the error)."
msgstr "A `required: true` addon cuxo paso de instalación falla debe fallar o xogo (No `failed_when: false` Enganar o erro)."

