# libretranslate
msgid "As a Infinito.Nexus platform operator, I want to provide a fully integrated, production-ready Penpot design and prototyping platform within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem so that teams can create, collaborate on, and share design projects directly inside their sovereign Infinito.Nexus installation."
msgstr "Como a Infinito.Nexus operador de plataforma, Quero proporcionar un deseño Penpot e prototipado totalmente integrado dentro da plataforma Penpot. Infinito.Nexus ecosistema para que os equipos poidan crear, colaborar e compartir proxectos de deseño directamente dentro do seu soberano. Infinito.Nexus instalación."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a client, each managed MCP Client Tool node MUST use Bearer or Header authentication and an explicit include list. The upstream `include: all` behavior MUST NOT be used for deployment-managed workflows."
msgstr "Como cliente, cada nodo MCP Client Tool ten que usar Bearer ou header authentication e unha lista de inclusión explícita. Baixar Upstream `include: all` O comportamento non debe utilizarse para fluxos de traballo xestionados por implantación."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor maintaining the per-role Playwright suite, I want every role whose `meta/services.yml` declares `ldap.enabled` (literal `true` or the dynamic `\"{{ 'svc-db-openldap' in group_names }}\"` form) to ship a Playwright scenario that exercises the LDAP-bind login path end-to-end, so that the LDAP variant of the role's authentication stack is verified independently from its OIDC counterpart."
msgstr "Como colaborador que mantén a suite Per-Role Playwright, quero cada rol cuxo papel sexa `meta/services.yml` declara `ldap.enabled` (literal `true` ou a dinámica `\"{{ 'svc-db-openldap' in group_names }}\"` forma) Para enviar un escenario Playwright que exerza o camiño de inicio de sesión con conexión a LDAP, de xeito que a variante LDAP da pila de autenticación do papel verifícase independentemente da súa contraparte OIDC."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor maintaining the per-role Playwright suite, I want every role whose login flow is RBAC-gated (OIDC and/or LDAP) to also exercise the canonical non-admin user `biber` end-to-end, so that the RBAC plumbing from [004 - Generic RBAC role auto-provisioning](README.md#archive) is verified per role rather than only on the privileged-admin path."
msgstr "Como colaborador que mantén a suite per-role Playwright, quero cada rol cuxo fluxo de rexistro é regulado por RBAC. (OIDC e/ou LDAP) Tamén exerce un usuario non administrativo canónico. `biber` fin a fin, para que o RBAC se esfumar de [004 Función RBAC Autoprovisioning](README.md#archive) É verificado por función en vez de só no camiño de administración privilexiada."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor to Infinito.Nexus, I want every role that ships application-level extensions to declare them through one unified `meta/addons/` contract (one file per addon), instead of today's per-app spelling (`addons`, `plugins`, `extensions`, `modules`, `mu_plugins`) scattered across `meta/services.yml`, `vars/main.yml`, and `tasks/`, so that addons are discoverable, lintable, and testable with a single schema, and so that any addon that bridges into another role declares that dependency explicitly through a service flag in `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "Como colaborador de Infinito.Nexus, Quero que todas as funcións que naveguen extensións a nivel de aplicación para declaralas a través dunha única `meta/addons/` Contrato (Un ficheiro por addon), No canto de per-app actual (`addons`, `plugins`, `extensions`, `modules`, `mu_plugins`) espallados por todo `meta/services.yml`, `vars/main.yml`, e `tasks/`, Para que os complementos sexan recoñecibles, lintables e comprobables cun só esquema, e para que calquera complemento que as pontes cara a outro papel declare que a dependencia explicitamente a través dunha bandeira de servizo. `meta/services.yml`."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor, I want a requirements template so that new requirements are consistent and machine-readable."
msgstr "Como colaborador, quero un modelo de requisitos para que os novos requisitos sexan consistentes e lexibles por máquina."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a developer, I want to run the Infinito.Nexus CI on a dedicated server so that the deploy + test cycle is no longer bound by local hardware restrictions."
msgstr "Como desenvolvedor, quero dirixir o Infinito.Nexus CI nun servidor dedicado para que o ciclo de implantación + proba xa non estea limitado polas restricións locais de hardware."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a maintainer of Infinito.Nexus, I want every user-facing string that core ships extracted into gettext catalogs and machine-translated by LibreTranslate through `make`, so that the API, the documentation and every consumer app serve all ISO 639-1 languages from one source of truth in this repository."
msgstr "Como mantedor de Infinito.Nexus, Quero que todas as cadeas orientadas a usuarios que os buques centrais extraídos en catálogos de texto e tradución automática por LibreTranslate `make`, Para que a API, a documentación e cada aplicación de consumo sirva a ISO. 639-1 Unha fonte de verdade neste repositorio."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want ERPNext (Frappe Framework) integrated as a `web-app-erpnext` role with OpenID Connect identity provider integration so that users can access the ERP through the same Single Sign-On (SSO) mechanism used across the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem, reusing the platform's central database and cache services."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Quiero apadrinar (Frappe Framework) integrado como a `web-app-erpnext` Integración con OpenID Connect para que os usuarios poidan acceder ao ERP a través do mesmo Single Sign-On. (SSO) mecanismo utilizado na Infinito.Nexus ecosistema, reutilizando a base de datos central e os servizos de caché da plataforma."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Checkmk](https://github.com/Checkmk/checkmk) integrated as a `web-app-checkmk` role with Keycloak SSO (via the oauth2-proxy gate) and native LDAP user management so that operators can run the open-source Checkmk monitoring server behind the platform's central Single Sign-On, validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Eu quero [Checkmk](https://github.com/Checkmk/checkmk) integrado como a `web-app-checkmk` Comentarios en Keycloak SSO (Vía Oauth2Porta Proxy) Xestión de usuarios LDAP nativa para que os operadores poidan executar o servidor de monitorización de Checkmk de código aberto detrás do Single Sign-On central da plataforma, validado de extremo a extremo coas persoas Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) integrated as a `web-app-jellyfin` role with Keycloak-backed Single Sign-On so that users can stream the media server behind the platform's central identity, validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Eu quero [Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) integrado como a `web-app-jellyfin` Papel con Keycloak-backed Single Sign-On para que os usuarios poidan transmitir o servidor multimedia detrás da identidade central da plataforma, validado final a fin coas persoas Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Semaphore UI](https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore) integrated as a `web-app-semaphore` role with OpenID Connect (Keycloak) SSO and optional LDAP login so that operators can run Ansible / Terraform / OpenTofu / Bash automation from a web UI behind the platform's central Single Sign-On, reusing the central database, and validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Eu quero [Semaphore UI](https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore) integrado como a `web-app-semaphore` Comentarios en OpenID Connect (Keycloak) SSO e acceso opcional LDAP para que os operadores poidan executar a automatización Ansible / Terraform / OpenTofu / Bash dunha UI web detrás do Single Sign-On central da plataforma, reutilizando a base de datos central e validado end-to-end coas persoas Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a `svc-ai-robot` role that turns one dedicated machine into an embodied platform for Hermes, giving the agent scoped-to-full host access so it can explore its own hardware and act in the physical world, so that Hermes can \"come to life\" on a robot while this power stays confined to a dedicated, segmented device and never leaks onto shared infrastructure."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Quero unha `svc-ai-robot` O papel que converte unha máquina dedicada nunha plataforma encarnada para Hermes, dando ao axente acceso a un hóspede cheo para que poida explorar o seu propio hardware e actuar no mundo físico. \"Ven á vida\" Nun robot mentres esta enerxía permanece confinada nun dispositivo segmentado e dedicado e nunca se filtra en infraestrutura compartida."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a `web-app-homeassistant` role that deploys [Home Assistant](https://www.home-assistant.io/) and exposes its native MCP server, so that agent employees (Hermes on a Pi, [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) and other MCP clients can control home devices as scoped MCP tools without any host access, making the \"isolated home assistant\" scenario concrete."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Quero unha `web-app-homeassistant` O papel que desenvolve [Home Asistente](https://www.home-assistant.io/) e expón o seu servidor MCP nativo, de xeito que o axente (Hermes en pi, [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) E outros clientes MCP poden controlar dispositivos domésticos como ferramentas MCP alcance sen acceso ao hóspede. \"Home Asistente\" escenario concreto."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a self-hostable `web-app-atmo` role that deploys an [atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) instance (upstream [flo-bit/atmo-events](https://github.com/flo-bit/atmo-events), the successor to OpenMeet) wired to the platform's existing AT Protocol identity, and a bridge that mirrors calendar events between AT Protocol and Mobilizon, so that events created on my instance appear simultaneously on the AT Protocol (Bluesky) network and the ActivityPub (Fediverse) network from a single source of truth."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Quero un autosuficiente `web-app-atmo` papel que desenvolve un [atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) instancia (upstream [flo-bit/atmo-eventos](https://github.com/flo-bit/atmo-events), O sucesor de OpenMeet) Conectado coa identidade do protocolo AT existente da plataforma, e unha ponte que reflicte os eventos de calendario entre AT Protocol e Mobilizon, polo que os eventos creados na miña instancia aparecen simultaneamente no Protocolo AT. (Bluesky) Redes e ActivityPub (Fediverse) dunha única fonte de verdade."

msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a single OpenAI-compatible LLM gateway that routes to any model backend (local Ollama, LM Studio, OpenRouter, ...), so that every AI consumer (OpenWebUI, Flowise, and the agent employees in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) targets one `/v1` endpoint and I swap or add model backends centrally without touching any consumer."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want every role with a documented Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface to expose or consume MCP through the platform's standard service, identity, proxy, and test contracts so that AI clients can use application data and actions safely without one-off per-role wiring."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Todos os artigos teñen un protocolo de contexto documentado. (MCP) superficie para expoñer ou consumir MCP a través do servizo estándar da plataforma, identidade, proxy, e contratos de proba para que os clientes de AI poidan usar datos de aplicacións e accións de forma segura sen conexión única."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want every role with an `application_id` to have an explicit, evidence-based MCP disposition and every suitable application to expose a narrowly curated MCP surface to Open WebUI, Flowise, n8n, and other approved clients so that applications can be connected without turning shared administrator credentials, raw infrastructure APIs, or arbitrary network access into agent tools."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Queremos que cada función teña un `application_id` ter unha disposición MCP explícita e baseada en evidencias e cada aplicación axeitada para expoñer unha superficie MCP limitada a Open WebUI, Flowise, n8n, e outros clientes aprobados para que as aplicacións poidan conectarse sen converter credenciais de administrador compartidos, APIs de infraestrutura en bruto ou acceso arbitrario de rede en ferramentas de axentes."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want the `web-app-matrix` role to gain a second deployment flavor that delegates the heavy lifting to the upstream [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD) playbook, so that the full Matrix ecosystem — Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Jitsi-backed video conferencing, ma1sd / Dimension / hookshot / etcetera — is available without the role re-implementing each service from scratch. The existing role-internal compose stack stays selectable as the `compose` flavor for one cycle, marked deprecated."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Eu quero o `web-app-matrix` papel para gañar un segundo sabor de despregue que delegue o levantamento pesado ao upstream [matriz-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD) playbook, para que o ecosistema de Matrix completo - Synapse, Element, cada ponte soportada, videoconferencia de Jitsi, ma1sd / Dimension / hookshot / etcetera - está dispoñible sen o papel de reiniciar cada servizo desde cero. A pila de composición interna existente permanece seleccionable como `compose` O sabor dun ciclo, marcado deprecado."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want to deploy self-hostable AI agent platforms (Hermes Agent, OpenClaw) as kernel-isolated, scalable \"employees\" across my nodes, coordinated by a Flowise supervisor over MCP and routed to models through the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway, so that I run a fleet of isolated agents with cross-agent pipelines and kernel-level isolation, without bespoke per-agent wiring."
msgstr "Como administrador da plataforma de Infinito.Nexus, Quero implementar plataformas de axente AI auto-hostable (Axente Hermes, OpenClaw) como illada por kernel, escalable \"employees\" a través dos meus nodos, coordinados por un supervisor de fluxo sobre MCP e encamiñados a modelos a través do [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) pasarela, para que eu execute unha frota de axentes illados con oleodutos cross-agent e illamento a nivel do kernel, sen empuñar per-agent."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator, I want Infinito.Nexus to support multi-node Docker Swarm deployments with NFS-backed shared volumes, so that services can be rescheduled across nodes without losing persistent data, scaled horizontally, and updated with rolling updates — gaining high availability without introducing Kubernetes complexity."
msgstr "Como administrador, quero Infinito.Nexus Para apoiar as implementacións multi-nodo Docker Swarm con volumes compartidos apoiados polo NFS, para que os servizos poidan ser reprogramados a través dos nodos sen perder datos persistentes, escalados horizontalmente e actualizados con actualizacións de rodamentos, obtendo alta dispoñibilidade sen introducir a complexidade de Kubernetes."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a self-hoster running Infinito.Nexus behind NAT/CGNAT/dynamic IP (Raspberry Pi, edge node, home server), I want a `svc-net-tor` role that makes the node's primary domain a Tor v3 `.onion` address so that the entire stack (web, SSO, LDAP, CA) is reachable over Tor without public IP, port forwarding, VPS, or DynDNS — while individual apps can still attach extra public domains with their own TLS."
msgstr "Como un home correndo Infinito.Nexus detrás NAT/CGNAT/dynamic IP (Raspberry Pi, edge node, servidor doméstico), Quero unha `svc-net-tor` O seu principal dominio é o Tor v.3 `.onion` dirección para que toda a masa (Web, SSO, LDAP, CA) É accesible sobre Tor sen IP pública, reenvío portuario, VPS, ou DynDNS, mentres que as aplicacións individuais aínda poden engadir dominios públicos adicionais co seu propio TLS."

