msgid "Every replica serves from the shared ``docs_sites`` volume. The replica holding ``builder.lock`` in that volume fetches and builds; the queue (``queue/``) and the build states (``states/``) are files beside the sites, so a new lock holder resumes the queue when the builder dies. Cross-node locking relies on NFSv4, the default of ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."
msgstr "Todas as réplicas serven do compartido. ``docs_sites`` volume. A réplica que sostén ``builder.lock`` en que o volumen e as construcións; a cola (``queue/``) Os Estados Construíndo (``states/``) son ficheiros xunto aos sitios, polo que un novo soporte de bloqueo retoma a cola cando o constructor morre. O bloqueo de nodos cruzados depende do NFSv4, O defecto de ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."

