# libretranslate
msgid "Extensive deploy and end-to-end hardening, much of it reproduced in Docker-in-Docker: native username and password login fallbacks for the no-SSO admin persona across Akaunting, Snipe-IT, YOURLS and OpenProject; OpenProject linked to the LDAP auth source for header SSO to fix a trusted-header 401, with all rails-runner Ruby extracted to dedicated files under *files/ruby/*; Shopware retries asset and theme builds against a restarting SeaweedFS; Mailu retries user creation and waits for antispam readiness before DKIM keygen; YOURLS creates its database schema on deploy; and OpenProject boots db:migrate under Ruby 4.0."
msgstr "Despeje extensivo e endurecemento final-de-fin, gran parte dela reproducida en Docker-in-Docker: nome de usuario nativo e login de contrasinal para a persoa non-SSO admin a través de Akaunting, Snipe-IT, YourLS e OpenProject; OpenProject ligado á fonte de acceso LDAP para a cabeceira SSO para fixar un xestor de confianza. 401, con todo o corredor de rascóns Ruby extraído a ficheiros dedicados baixo a licenza *Arquivos/rubia/*; Shopware recupera activos e temas constrúese contra un reinicio SeaweedFS; Mailu recupera a creación de usuarios e espera para a preparación antispam antes do keygen DKIM; YourLS crea o esquema de base de datos no despregamento; e OpenProject boots db:migrate baixo Ruby 4.0."

