# libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) e ensinar o nginx empaquetado para xestionar URLs de redirección de GCP Artifact Registry (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`)Actualmente `gcr.io` blob pulls son pasadas por `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` En [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), que é un entorno de traballo que desactiva a caché para os rexistros. Longo prazo: rebasear o upstream `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` regras para recoñecer a nova forma de redirección, enviar a corrección no noso garfo `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (O seu etiqueta de imaxe) en el forno y en el abismo, `NO_PROXY` bypass."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Fork `pull_request` As carreiras sempre reciben un token de só lectura (GitHub reforzado); A etiqueta nunca outorga tokens nin segredos ao acontecemento non confiado."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork main-branch sync: the push entry workflow now synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a working branch. See [the Actions configuration reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Sincronía principal de fork: o fluxo de traballo de entrada de impulso agora sincroniza o repositorio actual. *Principais* Repositorio fonte configurado (Por defecto *infinito-nexus/core*) Antes do alcance CI e despregamento de execución de descubrimentos, polo que un empuxe da póla de garfo só ve os seus propios cambios contra unha base up-to-date. Que clarividencia a de Millán Astray! *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* variable de repositorio, e as escrituras de forza sincronizada *Principais*Por tanto, un repositorio sincronizado non debe utilizarse como unha rama de traballo. Ver [Referencia de configuración de accións](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

