# libretranslate
msgid "New ERPNext role that ships the upstream Frappe Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task names at 120 characters."
msgstr "Novo rol ERPNext que navega polo Marco Frappe augas arriba15 stack como un web-app-erpnext papel - backend, frontend, websocket, programador e dous traballadores de cola - conectado no Keycloak central a través dun Keycloak Social Login Keycloak incorporado e no central OpenLDAP a través do do doctype de configuración LDAP. matriz de tres variantes (SSO Plus LDAP, non auth, LDAP) é exercido end-to-end e un re-wide lint caps Ansible nomes de tarefas 120 Personaxes."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Jitsi Meet role that adds an oauth2-proxy gated meeting surface plus matching LDAP-variant Playwright coverage. The spec layout is reorganised into a shared module and per-scenario test files so future scenarios can be added without touching the monolith."
msgstr "Novo Jitsi Un papel que engade un auth2- Superficie de reunión regulada proxida e cobertura de Playwright variable LDAP. O deseño de espectros reorganízase nun módulo compartido e os ficheiros de proba per-escenario para que se poidan engadir escenarios futuros sen tocar o monolito."

# libretranslate
msgid "New OUs SHOULD NOT be invented. Place users under `OU.USERS`, RBAC roles under `OU.ROLES`, and organizational groups under `OU.GROUPS`."
msgstr "O novo non debe ser inventado. Poñer usuarios baixo `OU.USERS`, funcións RBAC en `OU.ROLES`, grupos organizativos en `OU.GROUPS`."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Penpot role (web-app-penpot, requirement 235) that ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend, exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds, and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login, logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range."
msgstr "Novo papel Penpot (Web-app-penpot, requisitos 235) que navegue a plataforma de deseño Penpot augas arriba que comprende a frontend, backend, exportadores e Redis na versión de imaxe. 2.5.4, A conexión co Keycloak central vía OIDC e no OpenLDAP central. O login nativo local-password está dispoñible como un interruptor que se desactiva automaticamente baixo OIDC, coas bandeiras nativas e de rexistro derivadas da bandeira SSO. Unha libraría JVM personalizada importa o Infinito auto-asignado CA así OIDC sobre TLS ten éxito, eo papel é exercido de fin a fin con Playwright cubrindo OIDC login, logout e creación de proxecto. O subnet local foi trasladado a 192.168.105.192/28 Para evitar unha colisión co rango ERPNext."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Pi-hole role (*web-app-pihole*) that ships the upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta."
msgstr "Novo papel de Pi-hole (*Web-app-pihole*) que navega o pozo de DNS Pi-hole augas arriba e bloqueador de anuncios de toda a rede, coa súa interface web admin regulada detrás *Oauth2Proxy* Keycloak RBAC e un login admin-password nativo (El *FTLCONF* Web API contrasinal) Está dispoñible como variante fallback. O resolver augas arriba e a zona horaria son configurables, o papel espera no punto final HTTP de pozo Pi durante o despregamento, e é exercido de extremo a extremo con Playwright cubrindo o OAuth.2Escenarios de login nativo e acceso a convidados. O papel dos barcos no ciclo de vida beta"

