msgid "On a recent Docker engine the swarm step can abort at job setup; run `make act-runner-image` once and prefix the run with `ACT_PLATFORM_IMAGE=local/act-runner-fixed:latest` (see [Workflow Loop](workflow.md))."
msgstr "Nun recente motor Docker o paso do enxame pode abortar na configuración do emprego; executar `make act-runner-image` Unha vez e prefír o prefixo con `ACT_PLATFORM_IMAGE=local/act-runner-fixed:latest` (Ver [Workflow Loop](workflow.md))."

