# libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) and [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "xestores de sistemas operativos como [Apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [Pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) e [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) Manteña o software instalado en sincronización cos seus repositorios de distribución upstream. Cada un dos barcos cunha superficie de comandos diferente, pero todos teñen o mesmo obxectivo: actualizar o índice e actualizar todos os paquetes instalados no servidor."

