# libretranslate
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (``tasks/01_init.yml``) runs with ``application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq`` and ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; it resolves the consumer’s vhost name, username and password via ``lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)`` and reconciles an idempotent vhost, user and ``set_permissions`` grant scoped to that vhost. Existing vhosts and users are skipped, and the consumer password is realigned with the inventory on every deploy."
msgstr "Aprovisionamento por consumo (``tasks/01_init.yml``) Corre con ``application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq`` e ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; resolve o nome do consumidor, nome de usuario e contrasinal a través ``lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)`` e reconcilia un servidor, usuario e ``set_permissions`` Atribuímos a ese vhost. Os vhosts existentes e os usuarios son ignorados, eo contrasinal do consumidor é realigne co inventario en cada paquete."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (``tasks/01_init.yml``) runs with ``application_id=svc-db-redis`` and ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; it resolves the consumer’s username, password and key-prefix via ``lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)`` and reconciles an idempotent ``ACL SETUSER`` restricted to ``~{entity}:*``. The ACL users are recreated by the consumer’s ``01_init`` on every deploy, so a container restart that drops the in-memory ACL set is healed on the next run."
msgstr "Aprovisionamento por consumo (``tasks/01_init.yml``) Corre con ``application_id=svc-db-redis`` e ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; Resolve o nome de usuario, o contrasinal e o prefixo de clave a través ``lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)`` Conciliar un idempotente ``ACL SETUSER`` restrinxido a ``~{entity}:*``. Os usuarios da ACL son recreados polo consumidor. ``01_init`` En cada paquete, entón un recipiente reiniciar que cae o conxunto ACL en memoria é curado na seguinte carreira."

