msgid "`.env` is consumed by bash `source` and docker-compose `--env-file`, neither of which round-trips multi-line values; the writer therefore rejects them. Other NIX_CONFIG settings (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`, …) belong in `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile injects them inside the dev container; host operators set them once in `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."
